.\" Man page for himalaya-mcp-remove-ext
.\" Generated: July 2026
.TH HIMALAYA-MCP-REMOVE-EXT 1 "July 2026" "himalaya-mcp 1.8.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
himalaya-mcp\-remove-ext \- Remove the himalaya-mcp Desktop Extension
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B himalaya-mcp remove-ext
.SH DESCRIPTION
Removes the
.B himalaya-mcp
Desktop Extension from Claude Desktop. The command deletes:
.IP \(bu 3
The extension directory at
.BR ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/Claude Extensions/himalaya-mcp/ .
.IP \(bu
The settings file at
.BR ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/Claude Extensions Settings/himalaya-mcp.json .
.IP \(bu
The registry entry in
.BR ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/extensions-installations.json .
.PP
The command is idempotent: if the extension is not installed, it prints
"himalaya-mcp extension not installed. Nothing to remove." and exits 0.
.PP
After removal, restart Claude Desktop to apply the change.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/Claude Extensions/himalaya-mcp/
(macOS) Extension directory, removed if present.
.TP
.I ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/Claude Extensions Settings/himalaya-mcp.json
(macOS) Settings file, removed if present.
.TP
.I ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/extensions-installations.json
(macOS) Registry, entry removed if present.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success (or nothing to remove).
.TP
.B 1
Filesystem error during deletion.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Remove the extension:
.RS
.nf
himalaya-mcp remove-ext
.fi
.RE
.PP
Then fully remove the plugin from Claude Code:
.RS
.nf
himalaya-mcp remove
himalaya-mcp remove-ext
brew uninstall himalaya-mcp
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR himalaya-mcp (1),
.BR himalaya-mcp-install-ext (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Data-Wise
